{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 1418,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In just 2 decades, Texas barbecue has become"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 3837,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "an international icon\nof American tradition and craftsmanship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7757,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What used to be an affordable,\npractical meal for blue collar"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 10552,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "families has evolved into a gourmet\nMichelin star delicacy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 14389,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "drawing in tourists and locals\nwho line up as early as 5AM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 17767,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to dine at the state's most famous spots.\nThe South boasts"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21312,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the highest concentration\nof barbecue restaurants in the country."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25108,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Barbecue there is not just a meal, but a way of\nlife, and each state has its own style."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30113,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet it's the purist, no sauce, brisket-first \nstyle of Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33825,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "barbecue that has earned\nnational and global recognition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37245,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we look past the romanticism\nand glorification, barbecue in Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 41332,
    "dDurationMs": 1627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is a grueling business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42959,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Owners work from dusk till dawn, and only\na lucky few ever make the spotlight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 48131,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet no one knows how many barbecue spots\nthere are in Texas or in the South -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 51843,
    "dDurationMs": 1752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just that there's a lot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 53595,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Ask any historian, pitmaster, or LLM,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56264,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'll get wildly different answers\nthat are often thousands apart."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 60226,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "All the data available\ntoday is either hearsay or non-existent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64105,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No one's ever been crazy enough to count\nuntil now."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67358,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We scraped over 200,000 listings across\nnine states,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 70445,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and verified each one manually to produce\nthe first truly accurate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74074,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "snapshot of the American barbecue\nindustry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 77327,
    "dDurationMs": 917,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With these numbers,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 78244,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can truly understand just how extreme\nthe Texas market really is."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82791,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are more American\nbarbecue spots in Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 85418,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "than anywhere else in the world,\nand it's been that way for decades."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 89255,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If we combine all the spots\nthat have ever opened across the other"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92258,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five states in the barbecue belt,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 93843,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they still don't hold a candle to the Lone\nStar State."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96971,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's not just about size,\nit's also concentration."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100475,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even when stacked up against smaller\nsouthern peers, Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 103686,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still leads with the highest number\nof barbecue restaurants per capita"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 107524,
    "dDurationMs": 6214,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "7.3 spots for every 100,000 residents. Only\nthe best can survive in the saturation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113738,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and you'd have to be brave\nor mad to charge into this fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 117534,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Yet there's something unique about Texas,\nwhere demand runs so deep"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 120787,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that you still have a better chance\nof success here than anywhere else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124749,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since our data captures\nevery barbecue spot that's ever existed,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 127836,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we can calculate the industry's failure\nrate with confidence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131297,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "On average, one out of every three don't make it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 134217,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In Missouri, four out of every ten shutter their doors."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137387,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And in Oklahoma, it's over 1 in 3."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 139931,
    "dDurationMs": 4504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas uniquely sits in the middle\nwith the failure rate of exactly 33%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 145019,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Conventional business\nwisdom says that new players"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147480,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "should run away from competition,\nnot towards it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 150150,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But when we look at California, New York,\nand Florida, states that are less crowded,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 154404,
    "dDurationMs": 4212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "wealthier or more populous than Texas,\nthe failure rates are even higher."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158950,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Outside of the South, barbecue is a treat,\nnot tradition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 162245,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With lower demand and overall interest,\nit's tougher to keep doors open."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166207,
    "dDurationMs": 668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the South,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 166875,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the challenge is breaking through. \nThe smaller populations and slower"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 170336,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "economies mean that while survival may be\neasier, thriving is much harder."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 174924,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why Texas stands out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176509,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the hardest, but also the most\nrewarding place to start for the upside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 180180,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in business and prestige far exceeds\nwhat you would get opening anywhere else."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 184559,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you can make it here,\nyou can make it anywhere."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 187395,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But the question remains\nhow do you distinguish yourself"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 190106,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in the world's most competitive barbecue market?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 193151,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this Modern MBA Original,\nwe drive 956 miles across Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 198072,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to understand what it takes to win\nin the face of saturation"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 201201,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the invisible gatekeepers\npulling the strings on who thrives and who"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 205205,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "must pave their own path."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 214547,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today is chaos for every business owner."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 216758,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Commerce has turned volatile as tariffs\nget slapped on and then removed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 220053,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Trade policies shift and geopolitical\ntensions flare up week to week."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 224224,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While economists continue to deny\nthat we're in a recession"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 226851,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and that the stock market is booming,\ninflation is still up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 229687,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Consumer spending is slowing, unemployment\nis increasing, and layoffs persist"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 233733,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in every industry, with labor shortages\nand supply chains under pressure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 237362,
    "dDurationMs": 1751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cash flow is tighter than ever."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 239113,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Business has always been about evolution."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 241157,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you can't adapt in real-time,\nespecially in these moments,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 244327,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you're in for a world of hurt."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 245703,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What every business needs now\nmore than ever is total visibility."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 248706,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From global shipments\nto tariff impacts to real time cash flow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 252210,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's NetSuite by Oracle, your\nAI-powered business management"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 255672,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "suite trusted by over 42,000 companies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 258758,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NetSuite is the number one cloud ERP\nfor many reasons."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 261844,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It brings accounting, financial\nmanagement, inventory, and HR into one suite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 266140,
    "dDurationMs": 1252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You have one source of truth,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 267392,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "giving you the visibility and control\nyou need to make quick decisions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 270645,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With real time forecasting, you're peering\ninto the future with actionable data"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 274482,
    "dDurationMs": 1794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and with AI embedded throughout,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 276276,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can automate those everyday tasks,\nletting your team stay strategic."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 280363,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "NetSuite helps you know what stuck, what's\nit's costing you, and how to pivot fast."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 284701,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Modern MBA is small at the moment,\nbut as soon as we scale,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 287704,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "we will need and use NetSuite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 289372,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Today we're stitching things manually\nand it's hard to assess business health."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 292750,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a corporation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 293584,
    "dDurationMs": 2128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We pay tax throughout the year\nand it's a nightmare"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 295712,
    "dDurationMs": 2752,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "jumping from system to system\njust to get one answer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 298464,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are capabilities\nthat only NetSuite provides,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 300883,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's a platform that we intend\nto take every advantage of."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 304053,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's one system with full control\nthat can help you tame the chaos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 307473,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If your revenues are at least in the seven figures,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 310018,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "download the free e-book\nNavigating Global Trade: Three Insights"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 313438,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For Leaders at NetSuite.com/ModernMBA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 317191,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The guide is free to you\nat NetSuite.com/ModernMBA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 321571,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's NetSuite.com/ModernMBA."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 336669,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's 7 AM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 337545,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at Agape BBQ in Central Texas,\nand owner Jeremy lights the fire."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 341883,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He'll work until closing at 9PM."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 344469,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this line of work, 12 to 16 hour\nshifts are the norm. In Texas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 348765,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pitmasters are measured by brisket,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 350767,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the toughest part of the cow."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 352435,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It needs to be cooked for 10 to 18 hours\nfor the collagen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 355188,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to break down and every variable matters."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 358191,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Too hot and the meat dries out. Too long\nand it turns to mush."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 362612,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the natural fluctuations\nof a wood fire,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 365156,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "variation in cuts, and variability \nof hand labor,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 368701,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "everything is based on feel."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 371037,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pitmasters, like Jeremy,\nmust constantly execute and adjust daily"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 374540,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to all the elements."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 416916,
    "dDurationMs": 584,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Barbecue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 417500,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is uniquely high-labor, high-skill, and \nhigh food costs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 420920,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's fundamentally incompatible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 422505,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the conventional, high-volume,\nhigh-turnover restaurant business model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 426384,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As a product, it can't be reduced to exact\ntimers and efficient"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 429720,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "assembly lines like burritos, salads, burgers, or pizzas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 433641,
    "dDurationMs": 2795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no way to abstract\nthis operational complexity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 436436,
    "dDurationMs": 3294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and new equipment that can replace\nthe intuition of a pitmaster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 440440,
    "dDurationMs": 1751,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other angle is yield."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 442191,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Meat shrinks when it's cooked.\nWhile ground beef and chicken"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 444944,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "breast retain 75-85% of their \nweight after cooking,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 448573,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the yield on brisket after trimming \nand smoking is just 40%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 452577,
    "dDurationMs": 2794,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In practical terms, even though a pitmaster buys a 15"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 455371,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pound brisket, they get just 6 pounds of sellable meat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 458749,
    "dDurationMs": 2712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Since all barbecue has to be cooked hours\nahead of service"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 461461,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and can't be made on demand,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 462795,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "pitmasters must predict demand\naccurately every day."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 466215,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Cook too much\nand you throw money in the trash."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 468551,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's why most places in Texas\nwould rather sell out and close"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 471512,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "early than open late and risk leftovers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 474640,
    "dDurationMs": 835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These reasons are"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 475475,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "why there's never been a national barbecue\nchain, only regional ones."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 479312,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chains like Dickey's and Famous\nDave's do all the trimming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 482148,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and smoking at a central kitchen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 483691,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "before shipping the pre-cooked meat\nto stores in repeatable bags."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 487570,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This enables scale\nat the expense of quality, as chain stores"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 490740,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are run by teenagers with microwaves\nrather than pitmasters with smokers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 495369,
    "dDurationMs": 1836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the emergence of Texas barbecue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 497205,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "competing on availability\nand price has become a tougher sell."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 500958,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Dickey's has closed down nearly\nhalf of its locations in the past decade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 504378,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with similar regression\nin Famous Dave's and Sonny's."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 507757,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Like most chains, their business is \nnot selling barbecue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 510343,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but collecting royalties."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 512053,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The average Dickey's grosses\nless than $500,000 a year, down almost"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 516098,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "50% from 2013,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 518059,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "some of the lowest sales\nin the fast casual industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 521437,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The long hours and labor\nintensive work mean"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 523648,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the barbecue industry is driven\nmore by passion than profits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 527401,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a market dominated by independents\nand where chains have never made a dent."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 532114,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Our own data confirms this,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 533699,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even when we broaden the definition\nof a chain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 535826,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to any business\nwith three or more locations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 538996,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Chains have accounted for no more than 3%\nof all barbecue restaurants ever opened."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 544168,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of all the spots that are still open,\nall the chains added together barely"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 547672,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "represent a quarter of the barbecue scene\nin most states."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 550883,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But even though the chains\nhave the fastest, cheapest, and lowest"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 553928,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quality product, they have the best\nsurvival rate in the industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 557557,
    "dDurationMs": 4295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While 1 in 3 barbecue spots shut down,\nonly 1 out of every 10 chains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 561852,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "go out of business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 563187,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even with Dickey's mass closures,\nthe failure rates of chains are one third,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 567275,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sometimes one fourth of the overall\nfailure rate in every state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 571153,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "When one franchisee quits, there's often\nanother willing to take its place,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 575032,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "meaning the stores themselves\nrarely go under."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 577952,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thus, even though the chains will never\nbreak out of the bottom of the market,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 581664,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their simplified operations\nand economies of scale enable longevity"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 585459,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even in a market like Texas. \nIndependent owner / pitmaster"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 589338,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Jeremy, who make up eight out\nof every ten barbecue restaurants in Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 593259,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and across the country, are the ones\nwho face the harshest competition."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 597305,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Independents have the highest chance\nof closure as their failure rates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 600558,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "exceed the overall averages in every state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 603561,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They do it all alone without the brand\nrecognition marketing engine,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 607064,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "centralized production,\nand resources of a franchisor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 610484,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The long hours and high pressure\nalso leads to burnout,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 613321,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which contributes to that higher failure\nrate for independents."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 616782,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why so many barbecue spots\nare family-run with father and son or"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 620870,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "husband and wife teams splitting the labor\nto try and make it work."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 624832,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Still, Texas once again\nsits in the middle of the road."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 628419,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not as daunting as California,\nwhere nearly half of independents"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 631881,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shut down. For generations, Texas barbecue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 635343,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was seen as both a rough craft\nand humble meal for the working class."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 639180,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Value and availability\ntook precedence over quality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 642767,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "A pitmaster's skill\nlay in making the most out of cheap meat."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 646187,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in the 1950s, under Louis Mueller\nand the Schmidt family, barbecue in Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 650566,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "began to move upscale\nwith better cuts, wood, and precision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 654362,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the 2000s, Aaron Franklin\nand John Mueller pushed that boundary"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 658032,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to new heights."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 659158,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They each demonstrated that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 660451,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with dedication and the best ingredients,\na pitmaster could master all the elements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 664705,
    "dDurationMs": 4213,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to deliver unprecedented consistency\nand quality day in and day out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 669418,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their briskets ignited the modern craft\nbarbecue boom, and, decades later,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 673381,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still serve as the golden standard\nthat emerging pitmasters like Jeremy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 676842,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "strive to reach. For places\nthat aren't aiming"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 679970,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for the top of the market craft barbecue\nor bottom of the market chain barbecue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 684016,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there are ways to hedge\nagainst the high-cost, high-labor model."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 687311,
    "dDurationMs": 4963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You can boost yield by serving brisket\nalongside tacos, pizza, burgers or beer -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 692316,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "anything that shifts the spotlight away\nfrom the meat itself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 695486,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With a broader concept,\nthere's more room for differentiation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 698531,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "less onus on the quality of barbecue,\nand more ways to drive a sale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 702785,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "These are proven tactics\nfor the middle of the market, but today,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 706288,
    "dDurationMs": 1544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "craft barbecue is king"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 707832,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when you're chasing after the\ntop, there are no shortcuts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 712753,
    "dDurationMs": 709,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeremy got"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 713462,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "started seven years ago smoking briskets\nin his backyard for catering."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 717508,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Catering is like the minor leagues\nof the industry, where pitmasters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 720678,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "get to develop skills and build up\na following in a safe environment."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 724473,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The failure rate for caterers\nare substantially lower than that"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 727435,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of independent brick-and-mortars\nacross every leading state. In Texas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 731605,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only 18% of barbecue caterers\nshut down, compared"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 734734,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to the statewide 38% and\nan industry-wide 33%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 739071,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is because catering grants\ncost control and operating flexibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 742783,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that brick and mortar restaurants can't\nmatch. Since you know how much is needed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 746829,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and when, you can produce with zero waste.\nYou get paid,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 750666,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "you can test out equipment and technique\nwith real stakes, and you get customer"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 754378,
    "dDurationMs": 1835,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "feedback on your product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 756213,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a universal pathway as to this day,\nthere are as many,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 759884,
    "dDurationMs": 4504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if not more, caterers than chains in Texas\nand just about every other state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 765347,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeremy, like many in Texas,\nstarted as a one-man-army caterer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 769310,
    "dDurationMs": 834,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As business grew,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 770144,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he snowballed that momentum\ninto a weekend trailer and then eventually"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 773481,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "brick-and-mortar with Agape BBQ.\nTo hedge against burnout and cash flow,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 777985,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeremy has brought on Reagan"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 779528,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as an apprentice and Lonnie as a co-owner\nto help with business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 783699,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas is big, and choosing\nwhere to open is arguably"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 786452,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just as important as what you serve."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 788579,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Houston is the largest city\nand the most brutal market,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 791457,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "as nearly one in every two independents\nfail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 794543,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of the ten most popular"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 795711,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "cities, six have worse\nsurvival rates than the state average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 799882,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeremy and Lonnie have chosen\nto stay in Central Texas and remain close"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 803636,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to Austin, the birthplace of craft barbecue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 806764,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The city is home to market\nmakers like Franklin Barbecue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 809809,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Louie Mueller, and LA Barbecue - giants\nthat collectively set"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 813479,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ceiling for quality\nand pricing for the entire state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 817316,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For Jeremy and Lonnie,\nthe upside is that people here"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 820069,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have the proven income and appetite\nto support another craft barbecue spot."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 824698,
    "dDurationMs": 1377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The hard part is doing it in"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 826075,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "a way where you're not going toe\nto toe with the kings on their own turf."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 829870,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So instead of setting up in Austin proper,\nthey've hedged their bet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 833082,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by being the first and one of the fastest\ngrowing outer suburbs."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 865781,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While every storefront must adapt\nto their neighborhood"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 868117,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to succeed, the challenge for Agape\nis that it just doesn't exist yet."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 872288,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite tripling in size, Liberty\nHill is a sleepy suburb"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 875624,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "filled with mostly builder homes\nand gated communities."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 878711,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The downtown and surrounding commercial areas look"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 881338,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and feel like an abandoned movie\nset from an old Western."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 884592,
    "dDurationMs": 3753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite using the same top-tier\ningredients as the market leaders, Jeremy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 888345,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Lonnie have tried to embed Agape"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 890055,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "into the neighborhood\nby connecting with local officials"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 892683,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and pricing their product 8-30% cheaper \nthan the regional average."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 897229,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But five years in, the pair can no longer\nwait for the community"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 900566,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to organically materialize."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 934683,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's not that Liberty\nHill is underdeveloped."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 936894,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "By suburban planning benchmarks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 938604,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The town is performing as expected."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 942441,
    "dDurationMs": 1877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a $22 million Target"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 944318,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "currently under construction\nand pending plans for a Costco,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 948197,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but these stores realistically\nare years away from completion."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 951492,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Target is slated for 2027 and Costco\nfor 2029."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 956372,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's a bright future on paper\nfor Liberty Hill,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 958916,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but Agape must survive\nlong enough to reach it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 961627,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And while they're hanging\non, they're not breaking through."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 964630,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If Jeremy and Lonnie are to thrive,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 966298,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they need to go beyond word of mouth\nand bring in out-of-town customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 970052,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Texas isn't like California,\nNew York, or Miami,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 973222,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where social media can make or break\na restaurant overnight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 976433,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in this world of Texas\nbarbecue, a single listing"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 979186,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from a local publication carries\nmore weight than the Michelin Guide,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 982856,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Google, and Yelp combined."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 985192,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's Texas Monthly Magazine."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 987403,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the past decade,\nit's become the reigning authority"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 990114,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "powerbroker, and kingmaker of Texas\nbarbecue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 993659,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What started out decades ago as a fun\ncolumn to help sell more magazines,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 997663,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has suddenly turned into the barbecue\nBible, guiding tourists and locals"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1001834,
    "dDurationMs": 3461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who plan trips visiting\nas many nominated spots as possible."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1005796,
    "dDurationMs": 1043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With the stroke of a pen,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1006839,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they blow up obscure spots into acclaimed\ndestinations with lines around the block."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1011301,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The now famous Goldee's was barely a year\nold when it was named #1"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1014638,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "on their 2021 Top 50 list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1017683,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That recognition catapulted"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1019268,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the rural out of way shack\ninto international fame overnight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1023313,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Four years later,\ntheir lines haven't let up."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1026233,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For owners that are just holding on\nlike Jeremy and Lonnie,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1029528,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making the Top 50\nwould be winning the lottery."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1073280,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's like the Olympics."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1074448,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Barbecue spots only have one shot\nevery four years to make the list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1078410,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But if you can make the Top 50 just once,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1080537,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "doesn't matter if you're 49th or 12th,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1082831,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it's a momentum that can carry you\nfor the lifetime of your business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1086460,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Of the 119 unique spots named in the past 16 years,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1090339,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "only 13% have gone out of business\nsince their nomination."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1094259,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a substantial improvement\nover the statewide 38% failure rate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1098013,
    "dDurationMs": 4088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and gives brick-and-mortar independents\neven better survival odds than chains."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1102476,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In other words, getting on the list cuts\nyour chances of failure by two thirds."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1107231,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But statistically, you're more likely\nto get accepted into MIT"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1110734,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or Harvard than you are making it into the Top 50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1114279,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "What makes the list\nso powerful is its ability to activate"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1117324,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "both locals and out-of-state\ntourists who show up ready to splurge."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1185184,
    "dDurationMs": 959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Agape BBQ"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1186143,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grosses $55,000 a month for an annual run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1189188,
    "dDurationMs": 4337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rate of $660,000, higher than the average Dickey's,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1193525,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but lower than the fast food\nfranchises located just blocks away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1197487,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Agape's restaurant-level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1198655,
    "dDurationMs": 4672,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "operating margin sit at 11%, in line\nwith cookie shops and steakhouses"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1203327,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and below that of high-volume,\nhigh-turnover, fast-casual concepts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1208749,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And like every other independent\nin the state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1210918,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Jeremy and Lonnie are hoping for\nthe good news that they've made the Top 50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1233690,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "For establishments"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1234566,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that predate the craft\nbarbecue boom and Texas Monthly,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1237653,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the world looks very different."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1245577,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's 5 AM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1246495,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in East Texas\nand Spencer is already tending the pits."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1250290,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bodacious is one of Texas's oldest\nbarbecue chains"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1253043,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and has been feeding locals since 1968."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1256046,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Spencer got into the industry\nthrough his wife Madilynne,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1258924,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the granddaughter of Texas\nbarbecue legend Roland Lindsay."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1262636,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Roland scaled Bodacious\nfrom the single store into a franchise"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1265931,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "empire with 16 locations across the state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1269184,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As the third generation owner and heir, \nMadilynne knows the business inside and out."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329244,
    "dDurationMs": 542,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Central"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1329786,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas is fueled by tech, health\ncare, and hospitality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1333040,
    "dDurationMs": 2919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "East Texas is a lower income rural \narea that's"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1335959,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "sustained by the legacy\nindustries of energy and agriculture."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1339463,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It features the second fewest\nbarbecue spots in the state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1342799,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Things move slower here."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1344134,
    "dDurationMs": 1376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "People stick to what they know"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1345510,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and there's not much appetite\nfor craft barbecue or the next big thing."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1349806,
    "dDurationMs": 2419,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is why the odds of failure\nfor a barbecue spot"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1352225,
    "dDurationMs": 2962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in East Texas sit\nwell below the statewide averages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1355395,
    "dDurationMs": 4630,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at just 26% overall and 28%\nfor single store independence."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1360484,
    "dDurationMs": 2210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's a region where competition is minimal,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1362694,
    "dDurationMs": 1335,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "new players are rare,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1364029,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the existing players\nall stay afloat with loyal clientele."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1367908,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bodacious on Mobberly is the perfect\nrepresentation of this phenomenon."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1372204,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this city of Longview,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1373330,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's only ever been 13 barbecue\nrestaurants and only one has closed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1377250,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "down, setting a local failure rate of just 7%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1381129,
    "dDurationMs": 2461,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Madilynne, like her mother and grandmother,\ngrew up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1383590,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "busing tables and washing\ndishes in this very store."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1422129,
    "dDurationMs": 1209,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bodacious is a chain,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1423338,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but it's not the bottom of the market\nbarbecue like Dickey's."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1426675,
    "dDurationMs": 2252,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Madilynne and Spencer run this location."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1428927,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every other Bodacious in the state\nis run by a franchisee pitmaster who,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1432806,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Spencer, must trim, season,\nand smoke every cut of meat"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1436601,
    "dDurationMs": 2837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "by hand over wood, fire, and smokers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1439438,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are only nine chains in Texas\nto have ever reached this scale,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1442858,
    "dDurationMs": 2877,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Bodacious remains\nthe seventh largest chain in the state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1445735,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without a single penny\nfrom outside investors or venture capital."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1449448,
    "dDurationMs": 1042,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Bodacious wasn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1450490,
    "dDurationMs": 3253,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "built on the corporate capitalist model\nof a McDonald's or Subway."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1454327,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Spencer and Madeline\nhave updated Mobberly's menu"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1456955,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with touches of craft barbecue,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1458540,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Some Bodacious traditions\nremain untouchable, and none more"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1461710,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "so than the relationship with franchisees."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1530153,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Rowland didn't look at franchising \nas a cash grab."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1532822,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And generations later, Madilynne sees it\nthe same way every franchisee"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1536868,
    "dDurationMs": 1919,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "runs off the same contractual agreements"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1538787,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the 80s, where they pay\njust 1% of gross sales in royalties."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1542958,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Such low rates are completely \nunheard of today, where 5%"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1546169,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is the baseline even for brand-new,\nunproven fast-casual concepts."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1550840,
    "dDurationMs": 3713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only requirements for Bodacious\nfranchisees are to uphold the standards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1554553,
    "dDurationMs": 2043,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what they learned\nfrom Roland decades ago,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1556596,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to use the company's\nproprietary seasonings in the product."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1560141,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But in terms of what goes on the menu,\nhow it's smoked,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1562811,
    "dDurationMs": 4379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "what type of wood, all that is\nleft up to them to do what they deem best."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1602434,
    "dDurationMs": 2294,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 2017, Bodacious on Mobberly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1604728,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was awarded a Top Five spot in the Texas\nMonthly Top 50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1608565,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But back then, the location was run\nby a different pitmaster who quit"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1612402,
    "dDurationMs": 1168,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "due to burnout."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1613570,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Madilynne and Spencer\ndidn't take over until 2022,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1616906,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and Spencer brought his own recipes,\nstyles and techniques."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1620785,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The barbecue that was named\nthe fifth best in the entire state"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1623455,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "five years ago\nis not the same that served today."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1626583,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Unlike the Michelin Guide, where stars\ncan be lost as quickly as they're earned."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1630420,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Texas Monthly Top 50 is a lifetime honor."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1633423,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Once you're on it, you're on it -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1635008,
    "dDurationMs": 2169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if you don't make future lists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1637177,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pitmasters can leave,\nrestaurants can change hands,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1640347,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and recipes can be overhauled,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1642307,
    "dDurationMs": 1585,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but the Top 50 still sticks,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1643892,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and so does the prestige, differentiation,\nand attention that comes with it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1648104,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The only case where a prior award would not\nlast would be if the restaurant decided"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1651983,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to change its name, but no rational owner\nwould ever self-sabotage like that."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1721469,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bodacious on Mobberly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1722595,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "grosses $70,000\na month on average, for an annual run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1725974,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rate of $840,000."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1728977,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They've earned everything\na barbecue spot in Texas could ever dream"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1732063,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of local recognition, regional influence,\ngenerational loyalty,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1736651,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and a coveted Top 5 ranking from Texas Monthly."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1740864,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Their restaurant-level operating margins\nsit at 12%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1744200,
    "dDurationMs": 4505,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They sit comfortably in the top 1% in\nthe industry, in both accolades and scale."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1749247,
    "dDurationMs": 876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From one angle,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1750123,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Bodacious would likely have been even bigger"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1752459,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "if it had been founded in a booming region\nlike Central Texas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1756004,
    "dDurationMs": 1668,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But there's another side to it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1757672,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The conservative, traditional, tight-knit\ncommunities of East Texas"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1761426,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "may be exactly what has sustained their success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1764512,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This region has acted as a natural buffer,\ninsulating the chain"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1767974,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "from the disruptions of craft barbecue \nand ambitious new entrants."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1772061,
    "dDurationMs": 960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "At the same time,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1773021,
    "dDurationMs": 4421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the loyalty of generational customers\nwho value familiarity over quality"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1777525,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has created an invaluable environment\nfor Spencer to grow as a newer pitmaster."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1782322,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He gets to focus purely on the craft\nrefining technique,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1785658,
    "dDurationMs": 3212,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "dialing in recipes, and honing his skills\nwithout ever"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1788870,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "worrying about marketing\nor needing to build up a customer base."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1870618,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Emerging pitmasters are caught\nbetween two extremes -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1873454,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "either settle for slow, steady\nword-of-mouth or bank everything on"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1877041,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "making the Top 50 for immediate rocketship\ngrowth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1880378,
    "dDurationMs": 918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's 7AM"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1881296,
    "dDurationMs": 1876,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in North Texas, and Salhodeen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1883172,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "is preparing for the day ahead\nat his restaurant, Kafi BBQ."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1887051,
    "dDurationMs": 3838,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's a first generation pitmaster\nwho left behind his tech job and Stanford"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1890889,
    "dDurationMs": 3169,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "degrees to pursue a second career\nin the barbecue industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1894684,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "North Texas is the wealthiest region in the state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1897437,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "surpassing East Texas and central Texas\nby a wide margin."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1901316,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Median household income in the Dallas-Fort\nWorth Metropolitan hovers"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1904652,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at nearly $90,000,\nwell above the national and state medians."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1909157,
    "dDurationMs": 1543,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Where there's wealth, there's business"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1910700,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and North and Central Texas each claimed\n10% of the state's barbecue scene."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1915330,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One out of every three independent brick\nand mortar spots fail in this region."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1919959,
    "dDurationMs": 4296,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With today's saturation, good brisket\nalone no longer guarantees good business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1931387,
    "dDurationMs": 1210,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Salahodeen has bet"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1932597,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his business on not just product,\nbut also on position"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1935683,
    "dDurationMs": 4255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in catering to Muslims - an overlooked,\nunderserved market in Texas barbecue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1990154,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas is home to the fifth largest\nMuslim population in the nation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1993449,
    "dDurationMs": 4255,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "behind only New Jersey,\nIllinois, California, and New York,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 1998454,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the Dallas-Fort Worth Metropolitan\narea is home to the second"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2002041,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "highest number of mosques and Islamic\ncommunity centers in the state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2006754,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But Kafi isn't the first mover."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2008798,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are two spots that also serve\nhalal craft barbecue in North Texas."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2013052,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "One is a Pakistani food truck\nthat's a 30 minute drive from Dallas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2016472,
    "dDurationMs": 1502,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where most Muslims live."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2017974,
    "dDurationMs": 1334,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "They're only open on weekends,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2019308,
    "dDurationMs": 3421,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and they make so little that everything\ntypically sells out within the hour."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2023187,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The other is a brick-and-mortar\nthat's one hour away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2026190,
    "dDurationMs": 2670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Salahodeen's ambitions for Kafi barbecue exceed"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2028860,
    "dDurationMs": 2669,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that of a religious dietary restriction."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2031529,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The halal angle was born out of personal\nneed and not some plan differentiator."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2035867,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He wants Kafi to stand on its own\nas a great barbecue spot up there"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2039829,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with the Franklins of the world, where\neverything is made in-house from scratch."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2064020,
    "dDurationMs": 2044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Throughout history, Texas pitmasters"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2066064,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "have faithfully followed the old-school\nmantra of build it and they will come."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2070151,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's the trope that product trumps all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2072737,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Under this philosophy,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2073863,
    "dDurationMs": 4254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "good brisket makes up for bad location,\npoor service, and weak side dishes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2078159,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if a pitmaster can achieve\nthat level of product,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2080703,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "their success will be guaranteed."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2083081,
    "dDurationMs": 1918,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Salahodeen is the opposite."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2084999,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He's part of a new generation of\npitmasters who are not bound to tradition"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2088711,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and have bet their success on not just\nworking hard, but working smarter."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2093007,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As much as he obsesses over the menu,\ncustomer experience, and product,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2097136,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's not betting on brisket alone\nto carry his business forward."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2101015,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Salahodeen started in the minor leagues\nsmoking briskets in his backyard"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2105019,
    "dDurationMs": 1293,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for friends and family."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2106312,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And as his reputation and following grew,\nhe graduated to catering"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2110191,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and then eventually this brick and mortar.\nHis seven year"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2113361,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "journey has been a blend of new-school\nbusiness and old-school craftsmanship."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2117657,
    "dDurationMs": 750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While catering,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2118407,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he studied neighborhoods and analyzed\nsearch trends to assess demand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2122578,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This confirmed his hunch\nthat the center of the Dallas-Fort"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2125081,
    "dDurationMs": 1960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Worth Metro was a barbecue dead zone"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2127041,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with plenty of corporate chains,\nbut nothing of quality."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2130336,
    "dDurationMs": 3045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The reputable spots\nthat had been named in past Texas Monthly"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2133381,
    "dDurationMs": 3628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Top 50s were all at least a\n30-50 minute drive away."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2137468,
    "dDurationMs": 376,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It wasn't"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2137844,
    "dDurationMs": 3837,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "just about the distance from competition,\nbut also the proximity to customers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2142140,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Valley Ranch Mosque\nand the Islamic Center of Irving"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2144767,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "are the two largest, most famous mosques\nin the metro, and Kafi"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2148187,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "BBQ is only a five and ten minute drive away from each."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2164162,
    "dDurationMs": 750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Thanks to the steady"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2164912,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "stream of religious events\nand industry conferences in Dallas,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2168249,
    "dDurationMs": 3503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Muslim tourists can make up half\nof the foot traffic on certain weekends."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2172336,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If Agape or any other conventional non-halal \ncraft barbecue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2175756,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "restaurant was placed in his same spot,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2177967,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they would lose 60 to 70% of his customers\novernight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2181429,
    "dDurationMs": 2878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Salahodeen isn't some hardcore capitalist -"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2184307,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he's just applied the same precision\nthat he puts in his barbecue"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2187643,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and to the other\nequally important aspects of the business."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2191063,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Despite his engineering roots, he has\nno interest in automation and systems."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2195318,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Salahodeen takes the most pride\nin elevating the status"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2198154,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "quo by doing things the hard way\nand by hand."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2201115,
    "dDurationMs": 3087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "He uses only American Wagyu\nbeef for higher marbling,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2204202,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "which costs at least twice\nas much per pound than the USDA Prime"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2207538,
    "dDurationMs": 2002,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that's standard in craft barbecue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2209540,
    "dDurationMs": 2503,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Every week,\nhe drives a U-Haul to the only birth"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2212043,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to harvest farm in the country\nthat raises cattle from the purebred"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2215213,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Japanese Tajima bloodlines\nto pick out every cut himself."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2234023,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "None of these details are advertised\non the menu, but it's just the lengths"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2237318,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that Salahodeen is willing\nto go in his own pursuit of perfection."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2304510,
    "dDurationMs": 1084,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this industry,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2305594,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the ones with flashy websites and strong\nsocial media presence are usually only"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2309348,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the corporate chains or the commercialized\nTexas Monthly Top 50 spots,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2312893,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "hoping to catch the eyeballs\nof loaded tourists."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2315896,
    "dDurationMs": 3129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In a market where most pull, Salahodeen pushes."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2319442,
    "dDurationMs": 3211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His first ever hire was not\na kitchen helper but a videographer."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2323029,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even during a 12 to 14 hour shifts,\nhe still carves out time to film"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2326741,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "clips, post on Instagram, and engage\nwith viewers online."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2330619,
    "dDurationMs": 3879,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It's unorthodox in the world of Texas\nbarbecue, but it's just standard practice"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2334498,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for any other restaurant\nthat's trying to grow in this day and age."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2338210,
    "dDurationMs": 2378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Kafi BBQ is steadily climbing,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2340588,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even Salahodeen knows that\nmaking the Texas Monthly Top"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2343549,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "50 would be the greatest accelerant\nfor growth."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2346844,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Michelin stars are awarded\nthrough a group decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2349430,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The Texas Monthly Top\n50, in comparison, is an autocracy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2352975,
    "dDurationMs": 4046,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "where one person single-handedly decides\nwho does or doesn't make it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2357646,
    "dDurationMs": 3963,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That person is Daniel Vaughn,\nan Ohio native who turned his part-time"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2361609,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "enthusiasm writing about barbecue\ninto an editorial position"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2364904,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "at the magazine, where he's progressed\nfrom reporting to judging."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2368908,
    "dDurationMs": 3920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Michelin inspectors remain\nanonymous to eliminate potential bias"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2372828,
    "dDurationMs": 1126,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and exploitation,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2373954,
    "dDurationMs": 3254,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Daniel relishes the attention\nand privilege that comes with being"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2377208,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the judge, jury, and executioner\nof the Texas Monthly Top 50."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2381629,
    "dDurationMs": 2544,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His Instagram handle is @bbqsnob."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2384173,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His profile photo is a cartoon of himself\nas a Christian saint,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2387510,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "preaching Holy gospel was fork in hand,\nand he regularly participates"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2391472,
    "dDurationMs": 1710,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in media appearances."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2393182,
    "dDurationMs": 2336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even though he's run the list\nfor over a decade,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2395518,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "there's still no public criteria\nor rubric on how Daniel determines"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2399605,
    "dDurationMs": 3420,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "who makes the Top 50\nand what kind of barbecue qualifies."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2403651,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There's no explanation for why\nthe 10th place spot beat the 40 below it,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2407822,
    "dDurationMs": 3044,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or what separates\nthe 30th from the 29 ahead of it."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2411409,
    "dDurationMs": 3962,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In the simplest terms,\nthe Texas Monthly Top 50 is just a list"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2415371,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of what Daniel personally likes.\nWhile Google reviews, Yelp ratings,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2420042,
    "dDurationMs": 4463,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Michelin stars, James Beard Awards,\nOscars, college admissions,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2424505,
    "dDurationMs": 4171,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and even the local pie contest\nall share similar issues of subjectivity,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2428926,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "those accolades are still awarded\nby group decision."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2432430,
    "dDurationMs": 3878,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "With so much power concentrated\nin the hands of a single public figure"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2436308,
    "dDurationMs": 3629,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the Texas Monthly Top 50\nis inherently vulnerable to abuse,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2440104,
    "dDurationMs": 1626,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "intentional or not."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2441730,
    "dDurationMs": 2545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Daniel's decisions\ncarry enormous influence,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2444275,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "shaping the fate of barbecue businesses\nacross the state."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2447736,
    "dDurationMs": 2712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even as a differentiated\nleader, Salahodeen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2450448,
    "dDurationMs": 3336,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "still hopes Kafi BBQ \nwill someday make the list."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2536909,
    "dDurationMs": 3170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Business is all about picking the right\nmarkets, and Salahodeen"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2540079,
    "dDurationMs": 4045,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has struck gold by nailing\nproduct, location, and market all in one."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2544291,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kafi BBQ holds unprecedented\npricing power."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2547628,
    "dDurationMs": 3378,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The price of their Wagyu brisket\nis arguably the highest in the state,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2551131,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and it's 15% more expensive\nthan that of the industry titans"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2554426,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "like Franklin's, Interstellar,\nand LA Barbecue."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2557596,
    "dDurationMs": 3545,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But pricing at the tip of the market\nhasn't held back business in any way."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2561559,
    "dDurationMs": 4671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Kafi BBQ grosses on average,\n$200,000 a month for an annual run"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2566230,
    "dDurationMs": 4921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rate of $2.4 million, three times\nmore than Agape and Bodacious."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2571902,
    "dDurationMs": 4713,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "His restaurant level operating margin\nsit at 13%, by his own math."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2576657,
    "dDurationMs": 2377,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If Salahodeen were to delegate\nmore to his staff,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2579034,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his operating margins\nwould be closer to 10%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2581870,
    "dDurationMs": 2753,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "And if he hired less\nand took on more of the work himself,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2584623,
    "dDurationMs": 1961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "his margins would be 15%."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2640054,
    "dDurationMs": 667,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There are signs"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2640721,
    "dDurationMs": 3462,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that cracks may be forming in Texas\nMonthly's hold over the industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2644516,
    "dDurationMs": 3921,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Johnny White, owner of Goldee's, the same\nno-name joint that shot to fame"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2648437,
    "dDurationMs": 2711,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "after taking the number one\nspot on the Top 50,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2651148,
    "dDurationMs": 3337,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "has publicly criticized Daniel Vaughn\nand questioned the credibility"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2654485,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of a system that's driven by a single person's palate."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2657780,
    "dDurationMs": 4087,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "White's posts were only up for a few days\nbefore he allegedly received a cease"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2661867,
    "dDurationMs": 2628,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and desist letter from Texas Monthly,\nand was threatened"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2664495,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "with further legal action\nif he continued posting."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2667790,
    "dDurationMs": 2627,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "During the brief window\nin which his comments were public,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2670417,
    "dDurationMs": 3295,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "other owners and insiders\nechoed similar frustrations."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2674046,
    "dDurationMs": 3128,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "There were other owners we spoke to off\nthe record who are uncomfortable"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2677174,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "discussing it on camera\nout of fear of repercussions."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2680427,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even the owners featured in our episode\nchose their words carefully,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2684056,
    "dDurationMs": 3086,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "each doing multiple takes\nand preparing scripts ahead of time."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2687559,
    "dDurationMs": 4547,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While Texas Monthly publishes Top 50 lists\nfor everything from burgers and tacos"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2692106,
    "dDurationMs": 3795,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to bars and doctors, it's only barbecue\nthat has achieved this level"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2695901,
    "dDurationMs": 3670,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of cultural authority\nin its pursuit of paying subscribers."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2699780,
    "dDurationMs": 3712,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas Monthly has a clear incentive\nto protect the perceived prestige"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2703617,
    "dDurationMs": 2127,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of its Top 50 barbecue list,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2705744,
    "dDurationMs": 3379,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "even if that means suppressing dissent\nfrom within the industry."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2709498,
    "dDurationMs": 2836,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Johnny is not the first pitmaster\nto question the system,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2712334,
    "dDurationMs": 2211,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "but his comments carry tremendous weight."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2714545,
    "dDurationMs": 3587,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "As someone who's benefited enormously\nfrom the list, he has little reason"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2718132,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "to speak out\nwithout some legitimate cause."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2721301,
    "dDurationMs": 3504,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Agape and Bodacious\nmay be a completely different stages"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2724805,
    "dDurationMs": 4129,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "in their journeys, but each owner is\nchasing their own definition of success."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2729351,
    "dDurationMs": 3754,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Texas barbecue is a grueling business\nwhere one out of every three fail."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2733397,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But it's this difficulty\nthat makes the industry so revered."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2736817,
    "dDurationMs": 2586,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Everyone at the top\nhad to climb to get there."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2739403,
    "dDurationMs": 2961,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "While some may have had it easier\nwith a publicity boost,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2742364,
    "dDurationMs": 3003,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "they still had to work to capitalize\non that exposure."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2745617,
    "dDurationMs": 3671,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In this angle, Texas barbecue remains\none of the last expressions"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2749288,
    "dDurationMs": 4004,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "of American craftsmanship\nwhere business runs on perseverance over"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 2753292,
    "dDurationMs": 5088,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "profit and passion, not dollars,\nare the true lifeblood of every pitmaster."
    } ]
  } ]
}
